# FiveM license key — example / template.
#
# 1. Put your real license key on the FIRST NON-COMMENT LINE below,
#    with nothing else on that line (no quotes, no trailing text).
# 2. Save this file as `server/license.key` (same directory), not under
#    this `.example` name.
# 3. `server/license.key` is listed in .gitignore — it will never be
#    committed. Do NOT rename or copy a real key into any file that IS
#    tracked by git (this .example file included).
# 4. If a key is ever leaked (e.g. committed by mistake, pasted somewhere
#    public), revoke it and issue a new one immediately in the Cfx.re
#    Keymaster portal: https://portal.cfx.re
#
# Prefer this file or the environment variable over passing the key as a
# command-line argument: arguments are visible to other users in the process
# list on a shared machine.
#
# scripts/restart-and-check.ps1 and scripts/restart-and-check.sh read this
# file automatically as a fallback when neither -LicenseKey/--license-key
# nor the FIVEM_LICENSE_KEY environment variable is set.

cfxk_YOURKEYHERE
